# November 21, 2026: the Town of Hoosick outside the places already on the map (Eagle Bridge, Potter Hill, West Hoosick,
# Hoosick Corners and the village of Hoosick Falls), with four places in Sand Lake, Nassau and Schodack that earlier
# Rensselaer batches left as leads. Drawn at random by tools/choose.py --state ny (region renss). Sources opened in this
# session: HMdb marker pages and nearby lists (tools/page.py), including the Hoosick "Eye on History" panels of 2025;
